"""Source-backed earth/bedrock review; runtime map acceptance remains separate."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,html
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];OUT=ROOT/'development/levels/hollow-creek'
r=json.loads((OUT/'grounded-berm.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'));v=json.loads((ROOT/'development/levels/verification/hollow-creek-berm.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
page=['<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Camp Hollow Creek — shaped earth and bedrock</title><style>body{background:#171e1b;color:#e6e5d9;font:17px/1.6 system-ui;max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:28px}a{color:#b5d8bd}img{width:100%;height:auto}figure{margin:15px 0}.compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.gate{background:#29382d;border-left:4px solid #c5a16c;padding:16px}@media(max-width:780px){.compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><h1>Camp Hollow Creek — shaped earth and bedrock</h1><p>25 October2026 · Native/model refinement checkpoint</p><p>The old uniform flat-topped berm and gravel-covered blobs have been replaced. The bank now has a curved plan, rounded shoulders, varying widths and relief, small erosional gullies and worn-soil patches using the campsite material family. Twelve partly buried fractured stone wedges use a new solid-bedrock diffuse.</p><p class="gate">All views below are native Blender reviews, not running-game captures. Actual map movement/collision, ghost containment, renderer/optical/circuit/host/LAN, water layers and final encounter acceptance remain open. No map is unlocked.</p>']
for name,caption in [('toe','Standing camera at actual terrain+1.65m'),('toe-crouch','Crouched camera at actual terrain+0.95m'),('camp','Matched campsite approach camera')]:
 page.append(f'<h2>{caption}</h2><div class="compare">')
 for phase,label in [('before','Previous uniform boundary'),('after','Current rounded earth bank')]:page.append(f'<figure><img loading="lazy" src="../previews/hollow-creek/berm-{phase}-{name}-native-fitout.png" alt="{html.escape(label)}"><figcaption>{label} · {caption}</figcaption></figure>')
 page.append('</div>')
for name,caption in [('bedrock','Current solid weathered rock, fractured wedge outline and buried back/base. Camera uses actual ground+1.65m; original gravel spheres removed.'),('site','Current native site overview. Original ground, canonical van, tents, facilities, shoreline, culvert, lore and UV carriers remain.')]:page.append(f'<figure><img loading="lazy" src="../previews/hollow-creek/berm-after-{name}-native-fitout.png" alt="{html.escape(caption)}"><figcaption>{caption}</figcaption></figure>')
page.append(f'<h2>Actual fit checks</h2><p>Bank sections span{v["bank_width_range_m"][0]:.2f}–{v["bank_width_range_m"][1]:.2f}m total width, constrained around existing facilities and routes. Crest relief varies{v["crest_relief_range_m"][0]:.2f}–{v["crest_relief_range_m"][1]:.2f}m, including lowered fenced service returns. There is no repeated flat crest profile. Closed soil/stone shells,954 actual toe/ground probes,12 partly buried outcrops and{v["facility_vertex_clearance_probes"]} actual facility-vertex clearance probes pass.</p>')
page.append(f'<p>{v["rigid_crest_assemblies"]} crest assemblies were refitted without stretching:28 logs with both end bearings seated in actual soil, and24 rooted shrubs with attached branches/crowns. Maximum independent rigid-transform error:{v["max_rigid_refit_error_m"]*1000000:.3f}µm. The other{v["unchanged_other_mesh_geometry_uv_materials"]} meshes retain their exact source geometry, pose, UVs and materials.</p>')
page.append('<p>The renewed protected-route, ritual, floor, bedding, crouch entry, ramp, native-water-barrier and culvert checks pass on this scene. Two actual game-loader exports pass576 independent UV/PNG pixel checks within unchanged50k-triangle/4MB asset limits; their raw oriented triangles match the current native sources exactly. Existing14 site-art assets/4824 pixel checks also pass. These checks do not prove runtime player containment or performance.</p><h2>Sources and remaining work</h2>')
for a in r['assets']:page.append(f'<p>{html.escape(a["id"])} · {a["triangles"]} triangles · <a href="../blender/{a["id"]}.blend">editable source</a> · <a href="../../../assets/runtime/models/{a["id"]}.glb">runtime export</a></p>')
page.append('<p>The original bedrock bitmap and exact built-in image_gen prompt are saved with the project; only a packed512px derivative is used in exports. Continue log/bark/foliage weathering and distant-ground materials, inspect all changes in the actual world renderer, regenerate the stale physics export from this current scene, and implement the remaining gameplay/host/LAN and UV-goose encounter gates before another location.</p>')
for path,label in [('hollow-creek-grounded-berm.blend','Current native source'),('grounded-berm.json','Bank geometry and rigid crest-placement packet'),('../verification/hollow-creek-berm.json','Independent bank/support/source checks'),('../verification/hollow-creek-berm-fit.json','Routes and native fit checks'),('../verification/hollow-creek-berm-runtime.json','Actual game asset reader checks'),('../textures/hollow-creek/bedrock-v1.png','Original generated bedrock source'),('../textures/hollow-creek/bedrock-v1-prompt.json','Built-in image-generation prompt'),('SITE_ART_REVIEW.html','Previous site-art milestone'),('../../../beckenburg-development-gallery.html','Shared project gallery')]:page.append(f'<p><a href="{path}">{label}</a></p>')
